<para>Finds the first route whose prefix matches the start of <computeroutput>mime</computeroutput> and delegates to its <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_ingestion_toolbox_1affd43cdad59ce49fcfa9f83f381e4a7f" kindref="member">IngestionToolbox::extractEntities()</ref></computeroutput>. Falls back to the fallback toolbox if no route matches.</para>
