    <briefdescription>
<para>MIME-routing composite that dispatches entity extraction to the appropriate <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_ingestion_toolbox" kindref="compound">IngestionToolbox</ref></computeroutput> based on MIME-type prefix. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Thread-safety: the routing table is immutable after construction; concurrent <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_composite_1a2c8aba1213d7da45fd0f4f2b7cae5eaa" kindref="member">extractEntities()</ref></computeroutput> calls are safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
